Phasmid: user agent and client hints

What:     The UA string, navigator.userAgent, appVersion and platform, the
          Sec-CH-UA* headers and navigator.userAgentData come from os.*. The
          brand list is GREASE, Chromium and Google Chrome; every version is
          the build's own. No Headless token when automation.report_headful
          is set.
Why:      The UA, navigator.platform and every client hint must name one OS,
          and a two-entry brand list or a Headless token marks a non-Chrome
          or automated build.
Profile:  os.ua_platform_token, os.navigator_platform, os.ch_platform,
          os.ch_platform_version, os.architecture, os.bitness, os.wow64,
          os.model, os.form_factors, automation.report_headful
Hooks:    components/embedder_support/user_agent_utils.cc
          GetUserAgentBrandList, GetUserAgentInternal, GetPlatformVersion,
          GetPlatformForUAMetadata, GetFormFactorsClientHint,
          GetCpuArchitecture, GetCpuBitness, BuildModelInfo, IsWoW64;
          third_party/blink/renderer/core/execution_context/navigator_base.cc
          GetReducedNavigatorPlatform
Contexts: main, iframe, worker, shared worker, service worker, headers
Guard:    tests/guards/identity/user-agent.py

